canvasbio-cb2000
================

Copyright (C) 2025-2026 Kristofer Pagnussat

libfprint driver for the CanvasBio CB2000 fingerprint sensor (USB 2df0:0003).

Every source file here was written for this project and is distributed under
LGPL-2.1-or-later, as stated in each file header. The LGPL-2.1 license text
is in `LICENSE`. No third-party code is included and nothing is vendored.

The driver is built against libfprint's internal driver API, either as a
libfprint-tod module or inside a pinned libfprint tree:

  https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/libfprint/libfprint  (LGPL-2.1-or-later)

No libfprint source is part of this repository.

The behavior of the CanvasBio Windows driver and engine was studied to build
this one. No vendor code is reproduced, transliterated or included in any
form: only derived facts, which are recorded in `docs/PROTOCOL.md` and
`docs/RESEARCH.md`. CanvasBio, Samsung and Realtek are trademarks of their
owners and are named here only to say which hardware this driver is for.
